    {
      "edition": "SQL Server 2022 (16.x)",
      "items": [
        "SQL Server 2022 added the named WINDOW clause, which requires compatibility level 160. It also added IGNORE NULLS and RESPECT NULLS to LAG, LEAD, FIRST_VALUE, and LAST_VALUE; CU4 fixes a documented LAG/LEAD IGNORE NULLS issue. SQL Server 2022 added APPROX_PERCENTILE_CONT and APPROX_PERCENTILE_DISC, whose error guarantees are rank-based rather than value-based."
      ],
